y":"C","text":"I am do my homework."},{"key":"D","text":"I does my homework."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"现在正在做用 am doing。","verify":"\"I am doing my homework.\""},{"id":"cne_j070_q1","topicId":"cne_j070","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"It is Sunday morning. Tom is reading a newspaper. His mother is making soup. Tom 正在做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"做汤"},{"key":"B","text":"看电影"},{"key":"C","text":"打电话"},{"key":"D","text":"读报纸"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"is reading a newspaper。","verify":"\"读报纸\""},{"id":"cne_j070_q2","topicId":"cne_j070","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"It is Sunday morning. Tom is reading a newspaper. His mother is making soup. 妈妈正在做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"做汤"},{"key":"B","text":"读报纸"},{"key":"C","text":"看电视"},{"key":"D","text":"写作业"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"is making soup。","verify":"\"做汤\""},{"id":"cne_j070_q3","topicId":"cne_j070","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Gina is talking on the phone. She is not watching the movie. Gina 在看电影吗？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"在看"},{"key":"B","text":"没有"},{"key":"C","text":"和 Tom 一起看"},{"key":"D","text":"短文没说"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"is not watching the movie。","verify":"\"没有\""},{"id":"cne_j070_q4","topicId":"cne_j070","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Gina is talking on the phone. She is not watching the movie. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Gina is watching a movie."},{"key":"B","text":"Gina is making soup."},{"key":"C","text":"Gina is using the phone."},{"key":"D","text":"Gina is reading a newspaper."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"talking on the phone 就是在打电话。","verify":"\"Gina is using the phone.\""}]
